# Walking off a high ledge on Sidewinder, a drop of about four and a half
# world units: a fall fast enough to hurt (the falling damage's threshold is
# below it) and to land hard, which holds the player still for a while, the
# throttle held down all the while.
scenario fall_high
map sidewinder
# <name> <x> <y> <z> <yaw, radians>: a little above the ground, so that the
# player settles on it in the first ticks
start high_ledge -31.7185 -33.1219 0.65 0.3927
ticks 150
input 30 150 forward=1.0

# what the Rust simulation may differ from the C engine by: falling and
# landing are the same arithmetic as walking (see walk_slope)
tolerance position 0.001
tolerance velocity 0.005
tolerance facing 0.001
tolerance state 0
